WEBVTT

00:00:11.170 --> 00:00:16.170
Why must living creatures always
continue fighting each other?

00:00:16.280 --> 00:00:17.300
Lisa...

00:00:18.150 --> 00:00:19.310
Thank you.

00:00:23.750 --> 00:00:26.310
We've got to continue searching
for your parents, right?

00:00:32.530 --> 00:00:35.620
<i>Kaze... That man...</i>

00:00:47.240 --> 00:00:49.470
<i>White Cloud...</i>

00:00:52.110 --> 00:00:53.670
<i>How pitiful!</i>

00:00:53.780 --> 00:00:57.720
<i>You can't fire the Magun at will now, can you?</i>

00:01:04.890 --> 00:01:09.920
<i>I cannot fire the Magun at will.</i>

00:01:41.030 --> 00:01:46.830
The light of dawn pours over the vast Earth

00:01:41.030 --> 00:01:46.830
Daichi ni sosogu yoake

00:01:48.700 --> 00:01:54.340
And marks the beginning of our journey

00:01:48.700 --> 00:01:54.340
Tabidatsu toki wo tsugeru

00:01:56.310 --> 00:02:03.440
With our eyes on the future

00:01:56.310 --> 00:02:03.440
Mirai wo mezashi kaketeyuku kaze

00:02:03.920 --> 00:02:09.550
I deeply breathe in the rushing wind

00:02:03.920 --> 00:02:09.550
Kono mune ni suikonda

00:02:13.190 --> 00:02:19.190
The eyes that could only speak in dreams

00:02:13.190 --> 00:02:19.190
Yume dake wo kizamitsuketa hitomi

00:02:21.070 --> 00:02:26.700
Presented us with the path we're to take

00:02:21.070 --> 00:02:26.700
Bokura ni yuku michi wo ataeru

00:02:28.610 --> 00:02:32.410
Fly to the Neverland

00:02:28.610 --> 00:02:32.410
Fly to the Neverland

00:02:32.480 --> 00:02:41.910
Awaken the unlimited courage inside of us

00:02:32.480 --> 00:02:41.910
Kagiri nai yuuki wo mezamesasete

00:02:50.470 --> 00:02:53.830
Welcome to the night of Wonderland.

00:02:55.000 --> 00:02:58.730
I am Fabula, your guide.

00:03:01.080 --> 00:03:03.770
Our lost travelers continue their journey.

00:03:04.310 --> 00:03:10.480
He found hope that he would regain
his once prosperous Outside World.

00:03:11.550 --> 00:03:17.120
But it was only the Earl's trap,
used to provide food for Chaos.

00:03:18.090 --> 00:03:22.620
The blackness of their cruel hearts
runs very deep.

00:03:23.570 --> 00:03:27.500
A terribly harsh fate awaits the lost travelers.

00:03:28.870 --> 00:03:32.830
Now, once again, an unbelievable
terror draws near.

00:03:47.860 --> 00:03:54.560
Thanks to Lord Fungus,
Chaos is extremely happy.

00:03:55.830 --> 00:03:57.860
So full, so full.

00:04:02.000 --> 00:04:03.600
Your Excellency...

00:04:03.970 --> 00:04:05.410
What is it, Herba?

00:04:05.870 --> 00:04:08.680
We'd just become the Five Lords,

00:04:08.680 --> 00:04:12.370
but I guess now we're the
Four Lords once again.

00:04:13.880 --> 00:04:16.350
I guess you're right.

00:04:16.450 --> 00:04:17.920
How about you, Makenshi?

00:04:18.390 --> 00:04:22.550
As one of the Four Lords, I figure
you'll want a name, right?

00:04:25.760 --> 00:04:28.520
I have discarded such things.

00:04:31.100 --> 00:04:34.200
So just like we call that guy the Black Wind,

00:04:34.200 --> 00:04:38.140
shall we just start calling you White Cloud?

00:04:41.080 --> 00:04:49.510
How about this? Why don't we all go
to Chaos' room to watch him?

00:04:50.520 --> 00:04:52.680
I like the sound of that idea very much.

00:04:53.550 --> 00:04:55.920
<i>Chaos' room?</i>

00:05:04.570 --> 00:05:06.120
Hey, Lisa?

00:05:07.570 --> 00:05:13.370
I wonder if we'll ever really find our parents?

00:05:15.140 --> 00:05:16.540
It'll be all right.

00:05:16.540 --> 00:05:20.170
I'm sure that they are somewhere
waiting for you two to come.

00:05:20.720 --> 00:05:22.080
Let's keep at it.

00:05:22.580 --> 00:05:28.390
Yeah, but it just feels like it's been
so long since we left home.

00:05:31.130 --> 00:05:36.700
Mom and Dad told us about how they witnessed
the appearance of the Pillar of Darkness

00:05:36.700 --> 00:05:40.130
in Sadogashima, right before we were born.

00:05:42.140 --> 00:05:47.040
I was just a kid then, but I still remember it.

00:05:52.250 --> 00:05:56.050
Fighter planes and warships from
countries all over gathered

00:05:56.050 --> 00:05:58.180
and what happened was terrible.

00:06:05.090 --> 00:06:11.270
When the Pillar of Darkness expanded for
just an instant, Mom and Dad were taken in.

00:06:11.270 --> 00:06:16.840
It was connected to Wonderland, and
after traveling to many places,

00:06:16.840 --> 00:06:19.770
they were able to eventually
return home on the Subway.

00:06:23.040 --> 00:06:29.020
That's when they began their research
into Wonderland physics,

00:06:25.410 --> 00:06:29.350
Day of Conjunction

00:06:25.410 --> 00:06:29.350
Worldwide Bestseller!

00:06:29.020 --> 00:06:32.550
because their original jobs involved
observing the Earth's geological energy.

00:06:29.400 --> 00:06:30.650
Sadogashima

00:06:29.400 --> 00:06:30.650
Hayakawa

00:06:34.660 --> 00:06:37.680
Even after we were born,
that pillar was always there.

00:06:37.800 --> 00:06:40.900
Sadogashima

00:06:37.800 --> 00:06:40.900
Pillar of Darkness Tour Ship

00:06:37.800 --> 00:06:40.900
Daily Tours Now Running

00:06:38.990 --> 00:06:40.720
It even became quite the tourist attraction.

00:06:42.460 --> 00:06:44.660
The book that my parents wrote began to sell,

00:06:45.200 --> 00:06:49.570
and I thought we would all be
happy forever, but...

00:06:51.170 --> 00:06:55.940
That day, they said they were
going to look at Wonderland,

00:06:55.940 --> 00:06:58.240
but they never came back.

00:07:00.750 --> 00:07:04.910
That's when Sis and I decided
to go off looking for them.

00:07:05.690 --> 00:07:09.360
We heard that the Subway left at
thirteen minutes and thirteen seconds

00:07:09.360 --> 00:07:11.880
past midnight on nights when
there is a full moon.

00:07:12.430 --> 00:07:17.090
But I never knew it would turn
into such a huge adventure.

00:07:20.300 --> 00:07:22.290
That's right.

00:07:22.400 --> 00:07:27.030
I never knew it would turn into such
a huge adventure either.

00:07:31.310 --> 00:07:34.250
He's doing so well!

00:07:37.290 --> 00:07:40.760
Feeding on the hearts of those
consumed by terror,

00:07:40.760 --> 00:07:44.050
Chaos' core continues to
grow infinitely larger.

00:07:45.860 --> 00:07:47.620
What do you think, Makenshi baby?

00:07:48.260 --> 00:07:50.530
What are your thoughts after
seeing him for the first time?

00:07:51.530 --> 00:07:57.940
He turns negative, scattering thoughts into
energy as they writhe, struggle and suffer!

00:07:57.940 --> 00:08:01.140
That is Chaos' room.

00:08:02.340 --> 00:08:05.340
He's doing so well!

00:08:06.210 --> 00:08:10.450
By destroying and swallowing up
various Outside Worlds,

00:08:10.450 --> 00:08:13.490
and then by ensnaring the residents
of those worlds in chaos

00:08:13.490 --> 00:08:16.490
even after the world has been
incorporated into Wonderland,

00:08:16.490 --> 00:08:19.760
he grows even more powerful.

00:08:22.460 --> 00:08:25.520
But this is still nowhere near enough.

00:08:25.970 --> 00:08:27.760
I want more, more!

00:08:28.270 --> 00:08:31.900
More, more, more, I want
my stomach to be full!

00:08:32.470 --> 00:08:35.530
For Your Excellency to take
the seat of God here...

00:08:35.840 --> 00:08:39.510
That's what you need Omega for, right?

00:08:39.610 --> 00:08:43.210
Omega has turned into crystals and
is scattered all over Wonderland.

00:08:43.650 --> 00:08:45.850
I will gather them all!

00:08:45.850 --> 00:08:48.520
Once I do that, Omega will become complete!

00:08:48.890 --> 00:08:50.930
Rest easy, Your Excellency.

00:08:50.930 --> 00:08:54.120
Preparations to start up the Ocean
Puzzle have finally been made.

00:08:54.460 --> 00:08:57.450
Now all we have to do
is wait for the bait!

00:08:57.970 --> 00:09:03.100
Do it quickly, Pist! Before I get too hungry again!

00:09:03.200 --> 00:09:04.140
Yes, Your Excellency!

00:09:05.340 --> 00:09:06.700
<i>Omega...</i>

00:09:19.620 --> 00:09:22.280
Has something come?

00:09:25.060 --> 00:09:26.530
<i>This spirit...</i>

00:09:35.240 --> 00:09:36.670
It's Omega!

00:09:40.610 --> 00:09:42.970
No way! How?!

00:09:43.410 --> 00:09:45.570
Why is he always attacking us?!

00:10:05.770 --> 00:10:07.360
He's in a different form than before!

00:10:07.800 --> 00:10:10.070
Another form of Omega is after us again!

00:10:15.340 --> 00:10:20.010
<i>What should we do?! My Kigen Arts
don't stand a chance against it!</i>

00:10:21.580 --> 00:10:23.520
<i>At a time like this...</i>

00:10:23.620 --> 00:10:24.850
<i>If only that man...</i>

00:10:25.690 --> 00:10:27.450
<i>If only that man were here.</i>

00:11:13.000 --> 00:11:19.460
<i>I am a guide, therefore I cannot help you.</i>

00:11:20.370 --> 00:11:21.470
<i>Poshepocket...</i>

00:11:23.880 --> 00:11:26.470
<i>Take care of the lost travelers.</i>

00:11:27.250 --> 00:11:30.710
<i>Well, shall I guide you to the outside
of the dimensional tunnel?</i>

00:11:45.070 --> 00:11:46.500
So warm...

00:11:47.130 --> 00:11:49.730
Somehow we survived that.

00:11:49.840 --> 00:11:52.070
The Subway is broken though.

00:11:53.710 --> 00:11:58.340
This would be really bad if Poshepocket
hadn't supplied us with this heater.

00:12:01.050 --> 00:12:03.980
Especially since Chobi can't fly in this weather.

00:12:05.820 --> 00:12:08.790
I'm just glad no one was hurt.

00:12:10.160 --> 00:12:14.030
None of this would have happened
if that Mr. Kaze had been around!

00:12:15.160 --> 00:12:16.600
It's my fault.

00:12:17.700 --> 00:12:21.400
I'm always just relying on Kaze.

00:12:21.500 --> 00:12:25.300
It's my fault because I can't do anything,
even though I'm the man here.

00:12:31.380 --> 00:12:33.610
Yu, your strength is kindness.

00:12:34.120 --> 00:12:36.520
Kindness?

00:12:36.520 --> 00:12:39.490
But is that really worth anything?

00:12:40.090 --> 00:12:41.520
It's better than nothing.

00:12:42.290 --> 00:12:47.890
Yu, if you had the Magun, you'd never fire it
recklessly without thinking like Mr. Kaze.

00:12:48.500 --> 00:12:50.400
It might not seem like it,

00:12:50.400 --> 00:12:52.730
but I do depend on you, you know.

00:12:55.840 --> 00:12:59.640
I guess you're right. Thank you, Sis.

00:13:00.240 --> 00:13:01.880
That's right,

00:13:01.880 --> 00:13:07.250
you have to protect us weak ones
with that manly kindness of yours!

00:13:07.250 --> 00:13:09.310
What kind of line is that coming from you, Lisa?!

00:13:09.420 --> 00:13:11.210
Something wrong?

00:13:11.320 --> 00:13:12.580
Definitely wrong.

00:13:14.420 --> 00:13:16.550
You've got to get rid of that
kid-flattering laugh of yours too!

00:13:34.880 --> 00:13:35.770
Fu... Fu...

00:13:35.880 --> 00:13:37.900
Fungo!

00:13:51.790 --> 00:13:54.430
Welcome to the Comodeen,

00:13:54.430 --> 00:13:56.290
the only place in all of Wonderland
where order is maintained.

00:13:56.730 --> 00:13:59.220
This is our secret northern factory.

00:13:59.730 --> 00:14:01.240
Knave!

00:14:01.240 --> 00:14:03.000
I'm so surprised to see you in a place like this!

00:14:03.000 --> 00:14:04.870
This might be kind of lucky for us!

00:14:05.370 --> 00:14:09.210
We had plans to move out pretty soon,
so you really are lucky.

00:14:09.910 --> 00:14:14.680
<i>Lisa, I always believed that I was
certain to meet you again.</i>

00:14:15.150 --> 00:14:18.050
<i>Have you hardened your resolve
to join us in our fight?</i>

00:14:19.090 --> 00:14:21.990
<i>Well... You know...</i>

00:14:23.120 --> 00:14:24.320
Cid!

00:14:24.430 --> 00:14:26.860
No, not like this!

00:14:26.860 --> 00:14:28.660
Just when I get the chance to see you again!

00:14:28.760 --> 00:14:31.430
My poor Elizabeth!

00:14:31.430 --> 00:14:36.340
Oh, this is horrible! Elizabeth! Elizabeth!

00:14:31.570 --> 00:14:34.570
Yeah, I had a feeling Cid made the Subway.

00:14:34.600 --> 00:14:36.930
Yeah, and he gave it a girl's name too.

00:14:37.340 --> 00:14:39.400
Kazuharu Squad, Koyama Squad, quickly!

00:14:55.920 --> 00:14:57.860
I see now.

00:14:57.860 --> 00:15:01.830
I thought the Wonderland Watch,
Isabelle, had been customized again,

00:15:01.830 --> 00:15:05.300
but it turns out that he is now able to fly
with the power of the legendary Ciel armor.

00:15:05.300 --> 00:15:06.820
I envy him.

00:15:07.570 --> 00:15:10.660
The sky has boundless possibilities after all.

00:15:10.770 --> 00:15:13.930
Hey everyone, look! Check me out!

00:15:15.280 --> 00:15:16.900
Do I look cute?

00:15:17.850 --> 00:15:22.280
I think I'm going to get hooked on
helping girls change their clothes.

00:15:22.880 --> 00:15:24.450
That looks great on you, Ai!

00:15:24.450 --> 00:15:27.150
You're the only one that gets to
change again! That's not fair!

00:15:31.030 --> 00:15:34.520
He said that freshly cleaned hair tastes good.

00:15:36.500 --> 00:15:38.430
How nice!

00:15:38.430 --> 00:15:41.400
The sky really has such possibilities.

00:15:51.880 --> 00:15:53.040
Wow!

00:15:53.810 --> 00:15:58.650
This is the ultimate flying machine I have made
for the showdown with the Earl.

00:15:59.090 --> 00:16:00.610
Her name is Silvia!

00:16:01.090 --> 00:16:03.110
But she is not complete.

00:16:03.760 --> 00:16:07.420
I still need a precious energy
substance called Flying Water.

00:16:07.930 --> 00:16:11.020
According to Lisa, the Earl is looking for Omega,

00:16:11.330 --> 00:16:14.270
the one who has incredible destructive powers.

00:16:14.970 --> 00:16:19.670
I heard that Elizabeth, the Subway,
was attacked many times by Omega,

00:16:19.770 --> 00:16:23.910
but I believe the reason for that is Elizabeth's
nucleus, a fragment of antimatter,

00:16:23.910 --> 00:16:28.940
which is necessary in order to travel
through the dimensional tunnel.

00:16:29.350 --> 00:16:32.580
It is quite rare, even here in Wonderland.

00:16:32.690 --> 00:16:35.280
In actuality, it must have been a part of Omega.

00:16:36.360 --> 00:16:42.490
Perhaps he is searching for his scattered parts
so that he may once again become one.

00:16:44.730 --> 00:16:47.470
So it wasn't after us then.

00:16:47.470 --> 00:16:50.370
So, if the Earl gets his hands on Omega...

00:16:50.470 --> 00:16:53.200
No one will be able to stop him.

00:16:53.270 --> 00:16:58.680
That's right! In order to stop him,
I must complete Silvia!

00:17:01.780 --> 00:17:06.280
Why must living creatures always
continue fighting each other?

00:17:12.660 --> 00:17:18.330
Once the pure flower of your heart

00:17:20.270 --> 00:17:25.970
Can even be made to bloom in the midst of a storm

00:17:21.100 --> 00:17:24.040
The Magun, with its incredible flow of energy...

00:17:25.570 --> 00:17:29.410
Burn! I summon you, Phoenix!

00:17:27.780 --> 00:17:35.520
We will be wrapped in silence

00:17:35.520 --> 00:17:41.060
And born again in a world with no war

00:17:36.180 --> 00:17:37.420
Typhon!

00:17:40.550 --> 00:17:41.710
Shiva!

00:17:44.960 --> 00:17:50.750
It will continue to expand for all eternity

00:17:46.190 --> 00:17:47.690
Ixion!

00:17:52.500 --> 00:17:58.300
Filling our hearts with love

00:17:55.770 --> 00:17:56.640
Odin!

00:17:58.870 --> 00:18:00.200
Atmos!

00:18:00.310 --> 00:18:03.940
Fly to the Neverland

00:18:03.180 --> 00:18:06.550
Not even Omega could stand up to its power.

00:18:03.940 --> 00:18:13.580
While holding hands with the one whom I trust

00:18:09.280 --> 00:18:10.480
Ifrit!

00:18:23.260 --> 00:18:24.200
Titan!

00:18:38.950 --> 00:18:43.040
That man can only confirm his
existence through battle.

00:18:44.820 --> 00:18:47.010
Maybe that's just the kind of guy he is.

00:18:57.560 --> 00:19:04.200
This operation is to obtain Flying Water,
to provide energy for the flying machine!

00:19:04.200 --> 00:19:07.370
We're headed to the furthest reaches of the
seas of Wonderland, to a land called Teros!

00:19:08.080 --> 00:19:11.100
Deep-sea submarine Jane, launching!

00:19:43.480 --> 00:19:45.040
Hey, you two...

00:19:45.680 --> 00:19:47.580
Are you sure this is okay?

00:19:47.680 --> 00:19:50.650
Yeah, the Subway is broken anyway.

00:19:50.750 --> 00:19:53.720
If we get attacked by one of the Earl's
henchmen, everyone can help us!

00:19:53.720 --> 00:19:55.090
And what's more...

00:19:55.090 --> 00:19:58.290
Maybe Mom and Dad will be on
the other side of the sea!

00:20:03.100 --> 00:20:04.360
You're right.

00:20:05.470 --> 00:20:10.530
<i>That's right, the real fight is not to give up hope.</i>

00:20:11.210 --> 00:20:13.870
<i>I'm sure that he is out there too,
doing the same thing.</i>

00:20:32.900 --> 00:20:36.500
And now the journey begins

00:20:32.900 --> 00:20:36.500
Soshite tabi wa hajimaru

00:20:36.550 --> 00:20:40.100
Just the two of us going off

00:20:36.550 --> 00:20:40.100
Kimi to futari doko ka e

00:20:40.150 --> 00:20:43.650
Trance Euro Express passes through the night

00:20:40.150 --> 00:20:43.650
Trance Euro Express hashirisaru

00:20:43.700 --> 00:20:47.250
Riding into the distance

00:20:43.700 --> 00:20:47.250
Toorisugiru yakei ni

00:20:47.300 --> 00:20:50.750
Let me hear more of your heart

00:20:47.300 --> 00:20:50.750
Motto kokoro kikasete

00:20:50.850 --> 00:20:54.400
Let me close my eyes and be intoxicated

00:20:50.850 --> 00:20:54.400
Hitomi tojite yowasete

00:20:54.450 --> 00:20:58.000
Only the two of us are being taken

00:20:54.450 --> 00:20:58.000
Futari dake wo tsurete ku

00:20:58.050 --> 00:21:02.250
On this trip that we began with nothing but love

00:20:58.050 --> 00:21:02.250
Ai dake tsurete tabidatsu

00:21:03.250 --> 00:21:06.600
Romancing train, bring all the pain

00:21:03.250 --> 00:21:06.600
Romancing train, bring all the pain

00:21:06.650 --> 00:21:10.300
Bring your tired heart

00:21:06.650 --> 00:21:10.300
Tsukareta sono kokoro wo

00:21:10.350 --> 00:21:13.850
Romancing train, whistle again

00:21:10.350 --> 00:21:13.850
Romancing train, whistle again

00:21:13.900 --> 00:21:17.150
It embraces me softly

00:21:13.900 --> 00:21:17.150
Yasashiku daite kureru

00:21:17.200 --> 00:21:22.050
And I know that there is love here

00:21:17.200 --> 00:21:22.050
Ai ga koko ni aru koto

00:21:23.550 --> 00:21:30.350
Whisper into my ear until I fall asleep

00:21:23.550 --> 00:21:30.350
Nemuru made mimimoto de sasayaite ite

00:21:31.900 --> 00:21:35.550
Clouds hang low deep in the night
as the moonlight shines through

00:21:31.900 --> 00:21:35.550
Moonlight terasu shinya no
tachikomeru hikui cloud

00:21:35.600 --> 00:21:38.950
I can almost touch it if I reach out,
flying higher than ever

00:21:35.600 --> 00:21:38.950
Kono te nobaseba todokisou
tsukinukete maiagaru hodo

00:21:39.000 --> 00:21:42.650
Yeah, I turn the pages of my book softly
so as not to awaken you

00:21:39.000 --> 00:21:42.650
Yeah yawaraka ni nemuru
kimi okosanai you ni mekuru

00:21:42.700 --> 00:21:46.300
The old words in the paperback
tell a tale of romance

00:21:42.700 --> 00:21:46.300
Paperback furui kotoba tsuzurareta romance

00:21:47.700 --> 00:21:51.050
Romancing train, bring all the pain

00:21:47.700 --> 00:21:51.050
Romancing train, bring all the pain

00:21:51.100 --> 00:21:54.800
It moves onward with grace

00:21:51.100 --> 00:21:54.800
Susunde yuku yuuga ni

00:21:54.850 --> 00:21:58.400
On the romancing train

00:21:54.850 --> 00:21:58.400
Romancing train futari wa

00:21:58.450 --> 00:22:01.650
Together we seek out beauty

00:21:58.450 --> 00:22:01.650
Utsukushisa wo motomete

00:22:01.750 --> 00:22:07.450
Love is watching our dreams

00:22:01.750 --> 00:22:07.450
Ai wa yume wo mite iru

00:22:16.400 --> 00:22:19.130
Final Fantasy: Unlimited

00:22:20.800 --> 00:22:22.430
Here is my prophecy.

00:22:23.270 --> 00:22:25.930
The deep, deep bottom of the sea...

00:22:26.470 --> 00:22:30.340
The brave ones are attacked in a huge set-up.

00:22:31.310 --> 00:22:34.510
You mustn't leave! They'll turn you into bait!

00:22:40.550 --> 00:22:43.720
Next time, I will return to offer you
my Unlimited guidance.
